[2026-07-29 15:52:09,485 - Orcar.agent - INFO] conclusion='<Observation>\nThe bug is localized to field contribution. `Field.contribute_to_class()` in `django/db/models/fields/__init__.py` unconditionally assigns `get_%s_display` when `choices` is present, which can overwrite a user-defined `get_FOO_display()` override during model class construction. `Model._get_FIELD_display()` in `django/db/models/base.py` is only the shared implementation target for the autogenerated method, not the overwrite point. `ModelBase._prepare()` and `Options.add_field()` do not show competing logic that would preserve an existing override, so the field contribution path remains the primary suspect.\n</Observation>' bug_locations=[BugLocations(file_path='django/db/models/fields/__init__.py', class_name='Field', method_name='contribute_to_class'), BugLocations(file_path='django/db/models/base.py', class_name='Model', method_name='_get_FIELD_display')]
